# Build context of deploy/docker/web.Dockerfile is web/: the image is built from the sources and the lockfile only.
# Local installs and build output would replace what the image installs and builds itself.
node_modules
.next
*.tsbuildinfo
next-env.d.ts
# Test and coverage output.
test-results
playwright-report
coverage
# The design copy is never served or imported by the app.
design
# Local configuration and secrets never enter the image (next build does not read them either).
.env*
